	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0101_woman3_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうして……　どうしてなの？▼
かれと　おなじ　ポケモンを　そだてて
たたかわせたかった　だけなのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:14:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:16:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どうして……　どうしてなの？▼
彼と　同じ　ポケモンを　育てて
戦わせたかった　だけなのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:14:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:16:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・セイガイハ新婚イベント
・メッセージ表示後、階段前から移動
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T01:34:03" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WOMAN3
childcare_08</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:18:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T02:59:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0101_girl3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒトモシちゃんの　あかりに　たよれば
わたしの　しょうりが　みえてきます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T02:01:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T01:31:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒトモシちゃんの　灯りに　頼れば
わたしの　勝利が　みえてきます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
